<title>POLAND: BIG trades on kerb at PLN 3.5.</title>
<headline>BIG trades on kerb at PLN 3.5.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>A kerb transaction of 200,000 shares of Bank Inicjatyw Gospodarczych SA (BIG) at 3.5 zlotys a share was struck through the Warsaw bourse on Tuesday, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>At the regular session BIG rose 4.3 percent to 3.6 zlotys.</p>
<p>A kerb transaction of 72,059 shares of Bank Komunalny, which enters the bourse's main market on Wednesday, was struck at 11 zlotys, while another 94,271 shares in Bank Komunalny traded on the kerb at 10.9 zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
